OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting 'a whole society
OL,4,Aproblem', say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen suspects have been linked with
OL,7,Falmost 1,000 shoplifting offences in
OL,8,FEssex during a six-year period, figures
OL,9,Freleased to the BBC have revealed.
OL,11,FThe two most prolific culprits were
OL,12,Fboth suspected of shoplifting 124 times
OL,13,Fin the financial years between 2020-21
OL,14,Fand 2025-26.
OL,16,FSgt Christian Denning, who runs the
OL,17,Fbusiness crime team at Essex Police,
OL,18,Fsaid shoplifting was "a whole society
OL,19,Fproblem" which required a coordinated
OL,20,Fapproach to solve.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
