OL,3,GNEWSAShoplifting 'a whole society
OL,4,Aproblem', say police
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe offending details were released
OL,7,Fafter a Freedom of Information (FOI)
OL,8,Frequest and came as Home Office data
OL,9,Fshowed more than half-a-million
OL,10,Fshoplifting offences were reported to
OL,11,Fpolice across England and Wales in
OL,12,F2025-2026.
